{
  "$comment": "What kind of software a declared producer is (orazaka-packs#88). Matched case-insensitively as a substring of /Producer, /Creator, EXIF Software, an XMP softwareAgent or an office Application. The class explains a signal and never decides one: an editor is a tool people use every day. ocr explains a text layer over an image; editor raises PDF-META-004 / IMG-META-002 / XMP-HIST-001.editor. First match wins, so a specific pattern comes before a general one.",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "classes": {
    "editor": "edits an existing file (PDF editors, image editors)",
    "ocr": "puts a recognised text layer over a scan",
    "scanner": "a scanning app or device",
    "generator": "writes a document when it is issued (report engines, print drivers, office exports)"
  },
